  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bromley Youth Music Trust (BYMT) needs to raise 50,000 so our young musicians can keep making music. This year we have been OVERWHELMED with requests for financial assistance towards music lessons. PLEASE HELP BYMT to keep making music - we want to make sure EVERY child has the opportunity to play a musical instrument or sing in a choir. We know MUSIC CHANGES LIVES . Now, more than ever before, the benefits of music are essential for the future wellbeing of our young people.</narrative>
  </description>
